note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note gpu/nvidia/checks/arest-gseg.om: argseg (gpu/nvidia/om/apirest/gseg.om), as misc_parts() of CUDApp
note tests/api_rest_partitions.h calls it. Q its 16 q words, NY the output length; q after the call is output 128
note on. Composed before arestg.om.
text t_name "AREST-GSEG"
text t_gseg "gseg"
fn arop q view ulong 256 nq ulong ny ulong o edit ulong 256 to ulong
if or or ne nq 16 gt ny 8 not ckis 0 t_gseg
ckbad
end
a = new ulong 16 0
for i ulong 16
put a i get q i
end
y = new ulong 8 0x5a5a5a5a5a5a5a5a
r = argseg a part y 0 ny
for i ulong 8
put o i get y i
end
for i ulong 16
put o add 128 i get a i
end
ret r
end
